{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大号的两行标题，首先被紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”和“不自在了呢”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始担心有一天对方不再需要自己陪伴，甚至会觉得和自己待在一起不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、害怕被嫌弃或不再被需要。\",\n  \"missed\": \"眼下两人其实仍然亲近，对方一直没有退开，也许还喜欢他在身边；他对此有一点高兴。同时，他已经因此突然安静下来，不敢继续往远处想。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"中部白色大句和下部金色强调也相当醒目，与顶部标题争夺主视线。\",\n    \"下部内容同时包含现实中的亲近、对方可能的喜欢和自己的高兴，需要再看一遍才能理清这层安慰。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "01cc335a-1e8a-4f6b-bced-87ac75a51c17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011303735947Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:13:44.624220+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d2251c023526fb5eb006c14937f05eef956915447b99c7b21848d5efa9b50ace", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23